# ============================================
# IMPORTANT: Model and Dataset Files
# ============================================
# These files ARE tracked by Git LFS (.gitattributes)
# DO NOT ignore them - they are needed for the application to work
# 
# If you add large model/dataset files:
# 1. Update .gitattributes with the appropriate LFS pattern
# 2. Ensure Git LFS is installed: git lfs install
# 3. Files will be automatically tracked by LFS

